<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - April 11.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - April 11.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Mangalore port on April 11:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Timber		4,909 (ULD)  4,339   M V Sea Dian	 09/04</p>
<p> Urea		    543 (ULD) 30,891   M V Prathistha     09/04</p>
<p> Coal		  1,751 (ULD)  6,585   M V Lok M	    03/04</p>
<p> Timber		  164 (ULD) 11,731   M Selia		09/04</p>
<p> Wheat		 1,663 (ULD)    923   M V Asian Banner   26/03</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>ULD-To Discharge</p>
<p>LDD-To Load</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Mangalore)</p>
